  "description": "C8.6 neural canvas: learned clean two-state page reflow from x,y,t Learned warped/source coordinate features are included in the renderer MLP. Clean target fixture variant: naturalist-plate. Decoder samples a cross latent neighborhood with 1px radius for local glyph/detail context in source mode. Decoder also receives a separate always-visible target-state latent canvas initialized at scale 0.02. Training directly samples 0.35 of points from the reflowed midpoint glyph/text distribution. A contrastive source-remnant loss (0.25) penalizes midpoint pixels that are closer to the source page than the clean target by margin 0.025.",
